# An ability a resolved effect grants is the text of the effect that gave it (CR 611.2c), each instance its own. Den of the
# Bugbear's first activation resolves saying Goblin; Artificial Evolution then changes the Den's Goblin to Elf, and the second
# activation goes on the stack saying Elf. Turn to Frog in response takes every ability the Den has, the first activation's
# attack trigger included (CR 613.1f). The second resolves after it: the Den's one granted attack trigger is the second
# activation's, whose text says Elf, so attacking makes an Elf, not a Goblin.

[Bot1 Deck]
Den of the Bugbear
Black Lotus
